{"page":429,"verses":[{"verse_key":"34:8","surah":34,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"أَفْتَرَىٰ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ كَذِبًا أَم بِهِۦ جِنَّةٌۢ ۗ بَلِ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ فِى ٱلْعَذَابِ وَٱلضَّلَـٰلِ ٱلْبَعِيدِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Has he invented a lie about God? Is he mad?’ No! It is those who do not believe in the life to come who will suffer torment, for they are in gross error.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفْتَرَىٰ","en_gloss":"Has he invented","transliteration":"aftarā","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"about","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَذِبًا","en_gloss":"a lie","transliteration":"kadhiban","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَم","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"in him","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"جِنَّةٌۢ ۗ","en_gloss":"(is) madness","transliteration":"jinnatun","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَلِ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bali","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"in the Hereafter","transliteration":"bil-ākhirati","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(will be) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱلضَّلَـٰلِ","en_gloss":"and error","transliteration":"wal-ḍalāli","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْبَعِيدِ","en_gloss":"far","transliteration":"l-baʿīdi","verse_key":"34:8"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٨","en_gloss":"(8)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"34:8"}]},{"verse_key":"34:9","surah":34,"ayah":9,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَلَمْ يَرَوْا۟ إِلَىٰ مَا بَيْنَ أَيْدِيهِمْ وَمَا خَلْفَهُم مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ إِن نَّشَأْ نَخْسِفْ بِهِمُ ٱلْأَرْضَ أَوْ نُسْقِطْ عَلَيْهِمْ كِسَفًا مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَةً لِّكُلِّ عَبْدٍ مُّنِيبٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do they not think about what is in front of them and behind them in the heavens and earth? If We wished, We could make the earth swallow them, or make fragments from the heavens fall down upon them. There truly is a sign in this for every servant who turns back to God in repentance.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Then, do not","transliteration":"afalam","verse_key":"34:9"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَرَوْا۟","en_gloss":"they see","transliteration":"yaraw","verse_key":"34:9"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"towards","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"34:9"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"34:9"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"(is) before them","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"34:9"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"(is) before them","transliteration":"aydīhim","verse_key":"34:9"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"34:9"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خَلْفَهُم","en_gloss":"(is) behind them","transliteration":"khalfahum","verse_key":"34:9"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"34:9"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the heaven","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"34:9"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"34:9"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"34:9"},{"pos":13,"ar":"نَّشَأْ","en_gloss":"We will","transliteration":"nasha","verse_key":"34:9"},{"pos":14,"ar":"نَخْسِفْ","en_gloss":"We (could) cause to swallow them","transliteration":"nakhsif","verse_key":"34:9"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِهِمُ","en_gl